 "build": {
  "id": "8d9620a1-137b-41dc-8147-6e1a800b2682",
  "title": "5 Ghoul Animation AoE Guide",
  "description": "[overview]\nThis build focuses more on AoE damage using 5 [Raise: Ghoul](coa-skill:necromancer:500971) and March of the Dead instead of big single target boss damage like my other guide. This build works VERY well with a tank that likes to pull big and preferably LoS the mobs around a corner or against a wall. Also is great for leveling in dungeons if you have people who can do single target damage.\n\n[rotation]\n## Opener\n\n- Glacial Ward\n- Greater Grim Mandate (Greater Foul Mandate if you already have Grim Mandate from someone else)\n- Greater Razorice & Greater Chill of the Tomb (Optional)\n- 5 [Raise: Ghoul](coa-skill:necromancer:500971)\n- Cap Runic Power with [Glacial Tap](coa-skill:necromancer:805369) or Runic Harvest\n**Once tank plants**\n- Call of the Grave\n- [Animate: Skeletal Archer](coa-skill:necromancer:805040) (Big 25% haste buff)\n- [Animate: Bone Wraith](coa-skill:necromancer:805032)\n- [Animate: Plaguefather](coa-skill:necromancer:805048)\n- [Animate: Frost Wyrm](coa-skill:necromancer:805428)\n- [Unholy Frenzy](coa-skill:necromancer:805029)\n- March of the Dead (3x)\n- [Glacial Tap](coa-skill:necromancer:805369)\n- Runic Harvest\n- March of the Dead (3x)\n(Rinse and Repeat)\nYou may need to use [Crypt Swarm](coa-skill:necromancer:500965) for building Runic Power.\n\nThis rotation works very well if tank pulls massive and goes behind a wall, plant yourself so when the March of the Dead spawns, they will take like 1 or 2 steps and either collide with a wall or the pack of mobs (the tighter the pack, the better).\n\nAnother option is not using March of the Dead and focusing on your Command: Undead for your ghouls to do your AoE. Practically giving you infinite mana if the pull is big enough. Runic Harvest works a lot better with these ghouls since there is more to drain from.\n\n[stats]\n## Priority\n\n1. Hit Rating (Get to 16% or 128/128)\n2. Spell Power = Spell Damage\n3. Critical Strike Rating (10-12%~)\n4. Haste Rating (10-12%~)\n5. Intellegence\n6. Stamina\n\n[gear]\n## Here is my current gear setup I'm working towards.\n\n**Head:** Bad Mojo Mask - Mythic Zul'Farrak - Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz\n**Neck:** Purified Necklace of the Damned - Argent Dawn - Exalted\n**Shoulders:** Mantle of Lost Hope - Mythic Blackrock Depths - Lord Roccor\n**Back:** Amplifying Cloak - Mythic Dire Maul West - Magister Kalendris\n**Chest:** Robes of the Lich - Mythic Razorfen Downs - Amnennar the Coldbringer\n**Wrists:** Crystalline Cuffs - Mythic Ragefire Chasm - Zelemar the Wrathful\n**Main Hand:** Blood-etched Blade - Mythic Blackrock Depths - Summoner's Tomb\n**Off-hand:** Scepter of Interminable Focus - Mythic Stratholme - Sothos and Jarien\n**Wand:** Skul's Ghastly Touch - Mythic Stratholme - Skul\n**Hands:** Combed Furline Handwraps - Timbermaw Hold - Exalted\n**Waist:** Clutch of Andros - Mythic Scholomance - Kirtonos the Herald\n**Legs:** Skyshroud Leggings - Mythic Lower Blackrock Spire - Highlord Omokk\n**Feet:** Kayser's Boots of Precision - Mythic Lower Blackrock Spire - War Master Voone\n**Finger:** Arcane Loop - Vendor - 600 gold\n**Finger 2:** Band of the Titans - Vendor - Mark of Triumph\n**Trinket:** Briarwood Reed - Mythic Upper Blackrock Spire - Jed Runewatcher\n**Trinket 2:** Qiraji Shell - Cenarion Circle - Revered\n\n[enchants]\n**Head:** Lesser Inscription of the Wizard (+15 Spell Power & +12 Resilience Rating)\n**Shoulders:** Inscription of Supremacy (+10 Spell Power & +8 Resilience Rating)\n**Back:** Sustaining Cloak Lining (+6 Spell Power & +5 Stamina)\n**Chest:** Scorpion Strike Gambeson (+5 Hit Rating)\n**Wrists:** Healing Power (+15 Spell Power)\n**Main Hand:** Arcane Artillery (80 Spell Power for 15 sec.)\n**Wand:** Focused Precision Scope (+8 Critical Strike Rating)\n**Hands:** Minor Haste (+10 Haste)\n**Waist:** Magus Belt Buckle (+10 Intellect)\n**Legs:** Lesser Inscription of the Wizard (+15 Spell Power & +12 Resilience Rating)\n**Feet:** Lesser Accuracy (+5 Hit Rating)\n\n[leveling]\nEarly leveling, I recommend 1 [Raise: Abomination](coa-skill:necromancer:500335) with rest being Skeletal Warrior. Once you unlock [Raise: Ghoul](coa-skill:necromancer:500971) you will swap all your summons to just Ghouls. They give you insane self healing since each auto they do heals you and each Command: Undead you get even more healing, turning excess healing into an absorb shield making you feel unkillable thanks to [Life For Power](coa-skill:necromancer:705746).\n\n[macros]\n#showtooltip\n/cast Command: Undead\n/cast Grave March\n\n#showtooltip\n/cast Crypt Swarm\n/cast Grave March\n\n\n(Because our pets don't want to listen sometime.)",
